      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Forecast: United Airlines, Inc. v. Kincannon (No. 26-183)\\n\\nForecast at arrival: the petition was docketed August 12, 2026, the record shows\\nzero distributions, no CVSG, and no response yet (BIO due September 11, 2026).\\nEverything below forecasts forward from that state.\\n\\n## Distribution and relists\\n\\nThe docket shows **zero distributions** \\u2014 the arrival state, not a signal. The\\npetition will be distributed for conference with near certainty (~97%): it is a\\npaid petit",
